  "rules": [
    "Only exact full-name matching after NFKC and whitespace normalization.",
    "Treated: municipal first observed 2016-2022, unique initial registration city, observed prior fiscal gap, no earlier observed Qingke government-fund year.",
    "Same-year Choice core-financing anchors and exact province/industry level/normalized round; ambiguous multiple strata union reported separately from unique strata.",
    "Core financing includes explicit seed/angel/pre-A/A/B/C+ round labels, unspecified equity, strategic investment and pre-IPO; excludes listings, listed financing, transfers and acquisitions.",
    "Primary candidates exclude every municipal treated firm and every company ever overlapping Qingke; this is observed-government-history exclusion, not private-VC certification.",
    "Patent row absence remains missing; pair1 needs explicit numeric invention values at t-1 and t+1; all outcome years are capped at 2023.",
    "Alternative not-known-GVC-through-t+1 still excludes all 939 municipal sample companies and does not prove no government treatment.",
    "Same-day event links require actual day-level Qingke dates; month-level dates cannot establish same-day correspondence.",
    "Sameyear+fund checks match a token to the actual initial municipal fund legal name on a company-specific Qingke row.",
